# Two Claude sessions edit this tree with different newline conventions, which turned a
# 65-line change into a 2,381-line whole-file diff and silently broke an audit regex that
# spanned a newline. Normalise text to LF in the repository so a diff shows the change and
# nothing else.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.exe binary
